<section id="shanelle">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split client-founder-layout">
      <div>
        <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our Founder</span><h2>Meet Shanelle Snowden, MBA</h2></div>
        <p class="muted measure-620">Founder &amp; Executive Director | Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation</p>
        <p class="muted measure-620">For Shanelle Snowden, supporting dementia caregivers is more than a profession. It's personal.</p>
        <p class="muted measure-620">Her journey began at just 16 years old when her mother was diagnosed with younger-onset dementia. Witnessing the impact of the disease on her family shaped her understanding of the challenges caregivers face and inspired her commitment to creating the support and community she wishes her own family had experienced.</p>
        <p class="muted measure-620">Today, Shanelle brings years of experience in dementia care, a background in healthcare administration, and a passion for caregiver advocacy to her role as Founder and Executive Director of Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation.</p>
        <p class="muted measure-620">Through her leadership, Legacy is redefining what caregiver support can look like by creating opportunities for rest, wellness, education, and meaningful connection. She believes caregivers deserve more than resources to help them care for someone else. They deserve spaces where their own needs, identities, and well-being are recognized and valued.</p>
        <p class="muted measure-620">Her vision is simple: a world where caregivers are supported not just in their caregiving role, but as whole people with lives, dreams, and needs of their own.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="client-founder-photo">
        <img src="media/client-oct16/founder-img-7045.jpg" alt="Shanelle Snowden, Founder and Executive Director of Legacy" width="3024" height="4032" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

