    <p class="muted measure-620">Our Board of Directors provides leadership, guidance, and oversight to help advance Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation’s mission of supporting family caregivers and those living with dementia.</p>
    <div class="card-grid board-grid mt-24" id="board-list">
